@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Ghosting: split step and go
Ghosting, split step and go, three minutes. Medium pace, front corners. Reaching drops is about
starting early, not running faster. Split step as each call starts, push off hard, and lunge closed
with the racket already up. Swing on the beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
28% Rest. Wait just behind the T, not deep.
-0:03 [countdown]
36% @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
63% Rest. Racket up before you arrive. Stay low in the lunge.
-0:03 [countdown]
72% @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
---
[stop]
